    "name":  "Ceiling Light + LED Downlight - Circular - BONN White - Adjustable Power 18W - 16W - 14W - 12W - 5CCT - SMD2835 140Lm/W - IP44",
    "reference":  "PNRSW18W-CCT-91723",
    "short_description":  "\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003eThe \u003cstrong\u003eBONN Circular LED Ceiling + Downlight\u003c/strong\u003e is the versatile and efficient lighting solution your space needs. With \u003cb\u003eadjustable power (18W - 16W - 14W - 12W) and selectable color temperature (2700K, 3000K, 4000K, 5000K and 6000K)\u003c/b\u003e, it adapts to any environment.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003eIts high luminosity of \u003cstrong\u003e140Lm/W\u003c/strong\u003e and 120º beam angle make it perfect for illuminating homes, offices, or shops. Additionally, its modern design and IP44 protection rating make it an ideal option for both recessed and surface installation, combining style and functionality.\u003c/p\u003e",
    "description":  "\u003ch2 style=\"text-align:center;\"\u003eLED Ceiling + Downlight Circular BONN White - Adjustable 18W-16W-14W-12W - 5CCT - SMD2835 140Lm/W - IP44\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe \u003cstrong\u003eBONN Circular LED Ceiling + Downlight\u003c/strong\u003e. 5CCT (2700K-6000K), 18W-12W power. SMD2835 140Lm/W, 120º beam. Recessed or surface, \u003cstrong\u003eIP44\u003c/strong\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eApplications: Homes, offices, shops, hotels, multi-purpose.\u003c/h2\u003e",
